[{"id":4510565532,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDNnEnA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"4c33921aed79b0ed78f8fd4a24454776eb829193","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","login":"StarryWorm","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm"},"body":"At a quick glance, I would say this is the wrong fix to a real issue. \n\nThe issue appears to be that `VBoxContainer` in your scene is not putting the `ColorRect` in the right location, not that the `TextEdit` is reporting the wrong size. You can see your `VBox` has a size of `200,240`, with that height being computed from 20+200+20. However, for some reason, the bottom `ColorRect` is being drawn outside of the `VBox`. Image has the `Vbox` selected.\n\n<img width=\"466\" height=\"297\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fda74b6c-8f1c-407d-8b36-b044e012a8a6\" />\n\n\nFrom the way the system was designed for maximum sizing, `get_minimum_size()` **should not include it**. That's what `Control::get_bound_minimum_size()` is for. \n\nThe fact that changing it fixes it in this scenario indicates to me that I messed something up in `BoxContainer`'s children positioning code.\n\nI'll have to look into it but I suspect it's due to this line\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c92ef757cb0fbf3cd4495fcf4bd11299e743ed49/scene/gui/box_container.cpp#L70\nnot using bound minimum size instead of default minimum size... Frankly ridiculous oversight on my end if so.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120351#pullrequestreview-4510565532","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120351","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-16T21:45:53Z"},{"id":4518833774,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDVfubg","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e174dd68e1c4c21eb9c05558543526716ef7e673","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","login":"StarryWorm","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm"},"body":"LGTM! Needs maintainer approval.\n\nVerified that it doesn't reintroduce #120272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120351#pullrequestreview-4518833774","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120351","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-17T19:12:03Z"},{"id":4520254843,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDW2dew","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"e174dd68e1c4c21eb9c05558543526716ef7e673","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?u=ccfc0c8ff4c980eb77e097aa72e9ad04749294a9&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","login":"YeldhamDev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev"},"body":"Fixes the issue.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120351#pullrequestreview-4520254843","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120351","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-06-17T23:09:00Z"}]